{"archivedAt":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","archivedInDashboard":false,"attachedStylesheets":[],"authorName":"Shawn Peterson","categoryId":1,"contentTypeCategory":4,"createdAt":"2026-06-30T17:22:09.712Z","createdById":"26261533","currentState":"DRAFT","domain":"info.davincilabs.com","featuredImage":"","featuredImageAltText":"","htmlTitle":"Private Label Fitness Supplements | DaVinci Private Label","id":"216179449410","language":"en","layoutSections":{},"metaDescription":"Doctor-formulated fitness supplements for private label. Protein, BCAAs, creatine, DMG, CLA. Launch your fitness brand with 50 years of manufacturing expertise.","name":"Private Label - Page - Fitness Supplements","pageRedirected":false,"publicAccessRules":[],"publicAccessRulesEnabled":false,"publishDate":"1970-01-01T00:00:00Z","published":false,"slug":"pl-demo-fitness","state":"DRAFT","subcategory":"site_page","templatePath":"Private Label/Templates/Page.html","translations":{},"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T19:41:49.169Z","updatedById":"26261533","url":"https://info.davincilabs.com/pl-demo-fitness","useFeaturedImage":false,"widgetContainers":{"main_content":{"widgets":[{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(rgba(201,219,226,.85), rgba(201,219,226,.85)), url('https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/fitnesssupps.png') center/cover; padding: 90px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">PRIVATE LABEL FITNESS SUPPLEMENTS</p>\n    <h1 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 48px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 22px;\">Nutritional supplements that support fitness, performance, and recovery.</h1>\n    <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 34px;\">Fitness supplements provide vital nutrients to improve physical health, boost athletic performance, and aid recovery after exercise. Science-backed formulas support different goals whether your customers are fitness enthusiasts or professional athletes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 38px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Talk to Our Team</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762756,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">Build a fitness supplement line with proven formulations.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">More health brands are entering the fitness supplement business. DaVinci's private-label fitness line gives you expertly researched and tested formulations with superior, filler-free ingredients so you can differentiate your brand in a competitive landscape.</p><p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements, low minimums, and no set-up fees, you can build out a complete product line that fits your audience. Choose from our catalog of ready-to-launch formulations, customize the branding, and we handle manufacturing and fulfillment.</p>\n</div>"},"id":216207762757,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #c9dbe2; padding: 70px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px;\">HOW IT WORKS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 50px; line-height: 1.2;\">Get to market faster with a partner who handles the heavy lifting.</h2>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">01</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">BUILD YOUR PRODUCT LINE</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Direct access to over 250 doctor-formulated supplements with low minimums and no set-up fees. Choose what fits your audience and your timeline.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">02</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">DESIGN YOUR BRAND</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Use your existing logo, customize a new label, or pick from our professional templates. Our in-house design team brings your vision to life.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 56px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 14px;\">03</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">START SELLING FAST</p>\n      <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; opacity: .85;\">Launch in as little as 3 to 4 weeks after approving your labels. Every product passes rigorous quality assurance before it ships.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762758,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 70px 20px 30px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 12px;\">WHY FITNESS</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0;\">Why fitness supplements are a strong category to build a brand around.</h2>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762759,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 20px 20px 70px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">High-repeat purchase category</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Protein, pre-workout, recovery, and electrolyte products move on a monthly cadence. Predictable subscription revenue and strong lifetime value once a customer joins the line.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M15 19.13a9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6-2.18 9.38 9.38 0 0 1 6 2.18M15 19.13v-.41c0-.86-.16-1.69-.45-2.45M15 19.13v.13a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6 1.62l-.55 0c-1.05-.05-2.1-.05-3.15 0l-.55 0a1.62 1.62 0 0 1-1.6-1.62v-.13m6.85-2.86a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-2.85-1.05c-1.07 0-2.07.38-2.85 1.05m5.7 0a4.49 4.49 0 0 1 1.4 2.45m-7.1-2.45a4.49 4.49 0 0 0-1.4 2.45m2.85-7.95a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Zm6 0a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Clear, defined audience segments</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Strength athletes, endurance athletes, weekend warriors, general fitness customers. Each segment has different needs and price tolerances, letting you tier your product line strategically.</p>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; padding: 34px 30px; border-radius: 6px; border-top: 4px solid #6BA644; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(1,38,56,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:56px;height:56px;background:#c9dbe2;border-radius:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg></div>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px;\">Outcome-driven value proposition</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;\">Fitness customers know what they want and why: more energy, faster recovery, lean muscle, endurance. Less education means lower customer acquisition cost.</p>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762760,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: white; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Our fitness formulations available for private label</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">A selection of DaVinci's existing fitness supplement line, available for private label today. Schedule a consultation for the full catalog and custom options.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">HORMONAL</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Dimpro®</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Diindolylmethane (DIM) for hormonal balance supporting weight management and performance.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DIM</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Hormonal Support</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">MUSCLE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Right Whey™ Creamy Chocolate</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Whey protein for muscle synthesis and post-workout recovery. Creamy chocolate formulation.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Whey Protein</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Chocolate</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">30 Servings</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M21 7.5 12 12m0 0L3 7.5M12 12v9.75m0-9.75 9-4.5M3 7.5l9 4.5M3 7.5v9l9 4.5m9-13.5v9L12 21.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">MUSCLE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Right Whey™ Creamy Vanilla</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Whey protein for muscle synthesis and post-workout recovery. Creamy vanilla formulation.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Whey Protein</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Vanilla</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">30 Servings</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M15.36 5.21A14.92 14.92 0 0 0 14 4.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-1.74 4.42 8.27 8.27 0 0 0-1.51 5.34A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 7.5 9.5a8.27 8.27 0 0 1-3 6.36A8.25 8.25 0 1 0 17.5 9.18a8.49 8.49 0 0 1-2.14-3.97Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">ENDURANCE</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Gluconic® DMG 250 mg</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Dimethylglycine to train harder with less fatigue. Supports oxygen use and lactic acid metabolism.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">DMG 250mg</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Endurance</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M3.75 13.5 13.5 3l-2.25 7.5h6L9 21l2.25-7.5h-7.5Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">ENERGY</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Mito-Fuel</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Mitochondrial energy support for sustained training intensity.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">B-Vitamins</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Energy Support</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M12 3v17.25m0 0a47.78 47.78 0 0 1 3.83.15M12 20.25a47.78 47.78 0 0 0-3.83.15M9.16 8.34h5.66c1.04 0 2 .49 2.62 1.33L21 14.25H3l3.55-4.58a3.31 3.31 0 0 1 2.62-1.33ZM12 8.25c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75m11.25 3.75c0-2.07-1.7-3.75-3.75-3.75\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">BODY COMP</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Tonalin®-CLA</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Conjugated linoleic acid for fat loss while preserving lean muscle mass.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">CLA</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Body Composition</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M9 12.75 11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12c0 5.31-3.69 9.76-8.65 10.95a.84.84 0 0 1-.4.05.94.94 0 0 1-.41-.05A11.25 11.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.99c0-.46.31-.87.74-1.05A23.95 23.95 0 0 1 12 3a23.95 23.95 0 0 1 8.26 1.94c.43.18.74.59.74 1.05V12Z\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">FOUNDATION</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Vitamin C, B-Complex, Magnesium</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Foundational supplements supporting adrenal health, energy metabolism, and recovery.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Vitamin C</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">B-Complex</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Magnesium</span></div>\n    </div><div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 28px 26px; border: 1px solid #ebebe8; transition: box-shadow .2s;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #c9dbe2; border-radius: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px;\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#012638\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;\"><path d=\"M16.02 9.35h4.99V4.36M2.99 14.64h4.99v4.99M4.06 9.35a8 8 0 0 1 13.43-3.04l3.53 3.04M19.94 14.65A8 8 0 0 1 6.51 17.7l-3.53-3.05\"/></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin: 0 0 8px;\">STRENGTH</p>\n      <h3 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px;\">Creatine & BCAAs</h3>\n      <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 16px;\">ATP replenishment for high-intensity training and branched-chain amino acids for muscle recovery.</p>\n      <div><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Creatine</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">BCAAs</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; background: #f7f7f6; color: #012638; font-size: 12px; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 100px; margin: 0 4px 6px 0;\">Recovery</span></div>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762761,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #012638; color: white; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;\">\n    <div><img src=\"https://www.pettechlabs.com/hubfs/Private%20Label/Images/Why_Private_Label_Fitness_Supplements.jpg\" alt=\"Fitness supplements\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px;\"/></div><div>\n      <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">WHY DAVINCI FOR FITNESS</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 20px;\">Premium formulations, filler-free ingredients, ready to brand.</h2>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; opacity: .9; margin: 0;\">More health brands are entering the fitness supplement business, increasing the value they can offer their clients. Our private-label fitness line uses the latest advancements in nutritional science and superior, filler-free ingredients so you can differentiate your brand in a competitive landscape.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762762,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Build across multiple health categories</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px;\">Most brands start with one category and expand. Combine fitness with adjacent categories to grow lifetime value per customer.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;\">\n      <a href=\"/private-label-herbal\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/herbalsupps.png\" alt=\"Herbal\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Herbal</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-aging\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/agingsupps.png\" alt=\"Aging\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Aging</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-sleep\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/sleepsupps.png\" alt=\"Sleep\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Sleep</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-womens-health\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/womenssupps.png\" alt=\"Women's Health\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Women's Health</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-probiotics\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/probioticsupps.png\" alt=\"Probiotics\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Probiotics</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a><a href=\"/private-label-weight-loss\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\">\n      <div style=\"background: white; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(1,38,56,.08);\">\n        <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/weightsupps.png\" alt=\"Weight Management\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover; display: block;\"/>\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n          <p style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Weight Management</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762763,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032684,"label":"PL - Global Product Guide Link","module_id":218942529660,"order":8,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div id=\"get-started\" style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 80px 20px; text-align: center;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Ready to launch your fitness supplement line?</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; margin: 0 0 32px;\">Schedule a consultation and we will walk through your audience, the right fitness formulations for them, branding options, and the timeline. Most brands launch within 3 to 4 weeks of approving labels, 8 to 12 weeks from first conversation.</p>\n    <a href=\"#get-started\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #6BA644; color: white; padding: 16px 40px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 4px; letter-spacing: .5px;\">Schedule a Consultation</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762765,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032264,"label":"PL - Global Guide Offer","module_id":218944099153,"order":10,"type":"module"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #e6e5e3; padding: 90px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;\">\n    <p style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 0 0 14px;\">50+ YEARS OF SUPPLEMENT MANUFACTURING</p>\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 34px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; margin: 0 0 24px;\">Developed by us. Made for you.</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">With over 50 years in the health supplement industry, we are one of the most trusted dietary supplement manufacturers. Every private label supplement we produce is doctor-formulated using thoroughly researched ingredients, then scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before it ever enters production in our U.S. facilities.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">FoodScience is an FDA-registered food facility, GMP certified to SQF food safety standards, and certified to NSF GMP 455-2.</p>\n    <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 40px;\">When you partner with us, our expert team is with you every step of the way. Help your customers find what they want from a source they trust. You.</p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 50px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/DV_PL_Logo_SQF.png\" alt=\"SQF Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n      <img src=\"https://4087538.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/4087538/private-label/NSF.png\" alt=\"NSF GMP Certified\" style=\"height: 80px; width: auto;\"/>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762767,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{"html":"<div style=\"background: #f7f7f6; padding: 80px 20px;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 16px;\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 17px; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px;\">None</p>\n    <details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What does private labeling fitness supplements actually involve?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Private labeling means you launch a fitness product under your own brand using one of our pre-existing, doctor-formulated stock formulas. We handle manufacturing, quality testing, and bottling. You select the formulation from our catalog, design your label, and we produce the finished product ready to ship under your brand. No formulation work, no setup fees, no lab build-out.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What are typical minimums and lead times for fitness products?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Most fitness formulations have minimum order quantities in the low hundreds of bottles per SKU. Once your labels are approved, production typically takes three to four weeks before your first inventory ships. Custom packaging or formulation can extend that timeline. We give you exact MOQs and lead times for the SKUs you select during your consultation.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Can I customize the formulations or only the label?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Both paths are available. Private label means you use our existing fitness formulations as-is and put your brand on them. Custom formulation means our R&D team develops new fitness formulas to your exact specifications, with full proprietary ownership of the result. Custom carries higher minimums and longer timelines but gives you a real moat. Most clients start with private label and add custom formulations once they have traction.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>Are these fitness products FDA-compliant?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Yes. All our fitness formulations are manufactured in our FDA-registered, GMP-certified Vermont facility. Our formulations meet dietary supplement labeling requirements under DSHEA. Each batch is tested for identity, potency, and contaminants. You receive Certificates of Analysis with your inventory. We help you understand the structure-function claims you can responsibly make on your label.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>What if I need a fitness formulation that is not in your catalog?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">That is where custom formulation comes in. Our R&D team has developed hundreds of fitness formulations over the past 50 years. If your concept is doable within DSHEA and our manufacturing capabilities, we can build it. Custom formulation projects typically take 12 to 16 weeks from concept to production-ready, with higher minimums to amortize the R&D investment.</div>\n    </details><details style=\"background: white; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 14px; border: 1px solid #e6e5e3; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(1,38,56,.04);\">\n      <summary style=\"cursor: pointer; padding: 22px 28px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #012638; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\">\n        <span>How much does it cost to launch a fitness private label line?</span>\n        <span style=\"color: #6BA644; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-left: 16px;\">+</span>\n      </summary>\n      <div style=\"padding: 0 28px 24px; color: #444; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65;\">Total launch cost depends on the SKUs you choose, the packaging you select, and the volume you order. Most clients launch a 3-5 SKU fitness line for under $15,000 in initial inventory, including custom label design. There are no setup fees, no annual contracts, and no formulation costs for private label. We provide transparent SKU-by-SKU pricing during your consultation.</div>\n    </details>\n  </div>\n</div>"},"id":216207762768,"type":"rich_text"},{"body":{},"id":218950032685,"label":"PL - Global FDA Disclaimer","module_id":218942529652,"order":13,"type":"module"}]}},"widgets":{}}